window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Beaten. Broken. Battered. </p> <p>Garrett Falcon's past, present, and future are fragmented pieces of the life he once dreamed of. </p> <p>Deceits. Damned. Doomed. </p> <p>Raised by a dealer and addict, Juliana Torres was born into a life she desperately dreamed to one day escape. </p> <p>Two people who have lost hope. Two people who have been dealt blow after blow in their lives. </p> <p>What happens when these two are forced together after years of lies that connected them but also kept them apart? Their hearts get... </p> <p>Destroyed. </p> <p>Contains mature themes. </p>"; 
